Image modification: state folders of the agent on the data partition (/data/otapulse), device_type files
(/etc/otapulse, /var/lib/otapulse, /data/otapulse), installation of the OTA-Pulse .deb packages instead
of an upstream client, a check that the packages are installed and in bootloader mode, the persistent
machine-id helper and the socmond watchdog default (modules/support.sh, support/).

